  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The heartless is sustained by an eldritch heart replacement, although the exact nature of the new heart varies. At 1st level the heartless chooses what type of replacement, referred to as their heart core, they have received. Once the choice is made it cannot be changed.</p>\n<p>A list of heart cores and their effects are listed at the end of the class.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/heartless#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
